# This folder is a working demo vault: the system (Config, CLAUDE.md, README.md) and made-up
# sample notes are all tracked. Left out: Obsidian's per-device and personal settings, plugin
# code, and files the scripts generate.
#
# Outside .obsidian, only list exclusions here (no `!` lines). A personal vault that pulls just
# the system files from this repo keeps its own notes out of git with its own exclude file,
# and a `!` line here would override that (see CLAUDE.md).

# Settings: only the three that the scripts depend on are shared
/.obsidian/*
!/.obsidian/daily-notes.json
!/.obsidian/plugins/
/.obsidian/plugins/*
!/.obsidian/plugins/templater-obsidian/
/.obsidian/plugins/templater-obsidian/*
!/.obsidian/plugins/templater-obsidian/data.json
!/.obsidian/plugins/customjs/
/.obsidian/plugins/customjs/*
!/.obsidian/plugins/customjs/data.json

# Generated by the calendar sync, and its per-person settings note
/Config/Calendar Sync.md
/Config/Scripts/Calendar/calendar-events.json
/Config/Scripts/Calendar/calendar-sync.json

# The error log the time report and the calendar sync write (OBS-218)
/Config/Error Log.md

# Written by the Update Obsidian PM command in a vault that installed the system: where the
# clone is, and what it installed
/Config/Scripts/update-source
/Config/Scripts/update-manifest.json

# Obsidian's local trash
/.trash/

# Tests and fixtures built from a real vault's data
*.private.*

# Test plan notes left at the root of a dev vault
/*Test Plan.md
/.dev-vault/

.DS_Store

# Personal instructions for Claude Code
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
